WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:03.690
Unit six. Emergency Preparedness!

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.195
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.245 --> 00:00:11.178
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.228 --> 00:00:14.879
Today we learn about Emergency Preparedness. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.945 --> 00:00:19.962
Emergency kit. Say it with me. Emergency kit!

6
00:00:23.504 --> 00:00:27.987
Evacuation plan. Say it with me. Evacuation plan!

7
00:00:31.449 --> 00:00:34.882
First aid. Say it with me. First aid!

8
00:00:38.394 --> 00:00:42.710
Emergency contact. Say it with me. Emergency contact!

9
00:00:46.248 --> 00:00:50.565
Natural disaster. Say it with me. Natural disaster!

10
00:00:53.978 --> 00:00:57.278
Stay calm. Say it with me. Stay calm!

11
00:01:00.812 --> 00:01:03.912
Alert. Say it with me. Alert!

12
00:01:07.379 --> 00:01:11.196
Preparedness. Say it with me. Preparedness!

13
00:01:14.744 --> 00:01:27.404
Having an emergency kit and knowing the evacuation plan for my home helps in a natural disaster. Basic first aid and a list of emergency contact numbers are essential. Staying calm during an alert helps everyone stay safe.

14
00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:30.304
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:36.475
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:36.525 --> 00:01:37.675
First aid!

17
00:01:38.618 --> 00:01:43.698
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:43.748 --> 00:01:44.898
Alert!

19
00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:51.511
Did you know? Experts recommend having enough emergency supplies to last at least 72 hours.

20
00:01:51.561 --> 00:01:53.751
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:55.021 --> 00:02:02.844
Think and answer. What should be included in a home emergency kit?

22
00:02:02.894 --> 00:02:04.044
Great answer!

23
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:10.282
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:10.332 --> 00:02:13.107
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

